WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.533
Archives are everywhere.

00:00:02.533 --> 00:00:04.200
But the tools we open them with

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.400
still feel stuck in the past.

00:00:06.733 --> 00:00:08.000
Meet Trove.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.967
A free, modern archive manager for Windows,

00:00:10.967 --> 00:00:13.800
built on the trusted 7-Zip engine.

00:00:14.133 --> 00:00:19.933
Double-click any archive, zip, 7z, rar, tar or ISO,

00:00:19.933 --> 00:00:21.733
and browse it like a folder.

00:00:21.733 --> 00:00:25.033
Search inside, and extract just what you need.

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:28.133
Making one is just as easy.

00:00:28.133 --> 00:00:31.467
Right-click your files, choose Compress to ZIP file,

00:00:31.467 --> 00:00:32.633
and it's done.

00:00:32.633 --> 00:00:35.433
Or pick 7z, and choose Fastest,

00:00:35.433 --> 00:00:37.533
Balanced or Smallest.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.067
Need privacy?

00:00:39.067 --> 00:00:42.600
Add a password with AES-256 encryption,

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:44.833
hide the file names, or split a big

00:00:44.833 --> 00:00:47.733
archive into parts that fit any drive.

00:00:48.633 --> 00:00:50.700
And Trove keeps you safe.

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:52.300
Archives that try to write files

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:54.167
outside their folder are blocked

00:00:54.167 --> 00:00:56.333
before they can do any harm.

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:58.967
It runs on every version of Windows

00:00:58.967 --> 00:01:03.533
from 7 to 11, 64-bit, 32-bit and ARM,

00:01:03.533 --> 00:01:05.967
and it keeps itself up to date.

00:01:06.367 --> 00:01:08.533
Trove is free.

00:01:08.533 --> 00:01:11.833
Download it at nomanshafiq.com/trove
